synonym: "corpus Wolffi" RELATED [BTO:0001542]
synonym: "mesonephric kidney" EXACT [XAO:0000141]
synonym: "mesonephroi" EXACT OMO:0003004 [http://www.gudmap.org/About/Tutorial/DevMUS.html#DMK_Nephron]
