[Term]
id: UBERON:0001585
name: anterior vena cava
def: "A vein that carries deoxygenated blood from the upper half of the body into the right atrium of the heart." [http://orcid.org/0000-0002-6601-2165, Wikipedia:Superior_vena_cava]
