xref: Wikipedia:Intermediate_phalanges
is_a: UBERON:0003221 ! phalanx
intersection_of: UBERON:0003221 ! phalanx
intersection_of: distally_connected_to UBERON:0003221 ! phalanx
intersection_of: proximally_connected_to UBERON:0003221 ! phalanx
