property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "According to BrainInfo it is a part of the basal ganglia comprising the globus pallidus and striatum" xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Dorsal_striatum"}
property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "According to the 1917 version of Gray's Anatomy, it is the combination of the lentiform nucleus (putamen and the globus pallidus) and the caudate nucleus" xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Dorsal_striatum"}
property_value: UBPROP:0000001 "It may also refer to both the basal ganglia and the internal capsule collectively." xsd:string {source="Wikipedia:Dorsal_striatum"}
