is_a: UBERON:0006598 ! presumptive structure
intersection_of: UBERON:0000926 ! mesoderm
intersection_of: RO:0002387 UBERON:0002120 ! pronephros
relationship: BFO:0000050 UBERON:0003064 {source="ZFA"} ! intermediate mesoderm
