[Term]
id: UBERON:0008881
name: rostral migratory stream
def: "Unique telencephalic subventricular zones that extend from the lateral ventricles into the olfactory bulbs. Newly produced GABAergic interneurons migrate along the RMS and settle in the bulb." [BIRNLEX:1702, PMID:12453055]
subset: pheno_slim
synonym: "RMS" RELATED OMO:0003000 [BTO:0003412]
synonym: "rostral migratory pathway" RELATED [Wikipedia:Rostral_migratory_stream]
