relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0050982

[Term]
id: UBERON:0012451
name: sensory receptor
def: "A sensory nerve ending that responds to a stimulus in the internal or external environment of an organism. In response to stimuli the sensory receptor initiates sensory transduction by creating graded potentials or action potentials in the same cell or in an adjacent one." [Wikipedia:Sensory_receptor]
synonym: "peripheral ending of sensory neuron" EXACT [FMA:84650]
synonym: "sensory nerve ending" RELATED [MESH:A08.800.550.700]
